Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,击向脑袋左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head caught to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,废其听力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Partial deafness in ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First point of attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,第二 击向喉咙 废其声带 让他叫不出声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, throat. Paralyze the vocal cords, stop screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,第三 肯定是酒鬼 对准肝脏方向猛击肋骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, got to be a heavy drinker. Punch the rib to the liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,第四 也就是最后 拖住左腿 击碎膝盖骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four, finally, drag the left leg. Fist the patella.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:02:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小结 不省人事90秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Summary prognosis Exactly 90 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击效果 最多15分钟 完全康复 不太可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Complete recovery of the colleges Unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帽子不错 - 我捡来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like the hat. - I just picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你没带枪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember your revolver?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道会忘带东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I'd forgotten something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为家里炉子没关上 - 确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought I'd left the stove on. - You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,应该够了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟你是医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a doctor, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你一向很开心 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always nice to see you, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,警长呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the inspector?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在召集人马呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's getting his troops lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不知道要等到什么时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could be all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,歇洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还有他那条哈巴狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his loyal dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好奇 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,作为一名医务工作者 你是否 喜欢过我的杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a medical man, have you enjoyed my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让你看看 我有多喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you how much I've enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这就是我在找的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I was looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Blackwood!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像有点吃惊啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说我们更应该关心那姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would say that the girl deserves our attention more than he.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我要是你的话就不会去碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'd leave that alone if I were you, boyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来的真是时候 雷斯垂德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impeccable timing, Lestrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一个进医院 一个送刑场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've one for the doctor, and one for the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉基 - 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clarky? - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这位女士要马上送医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This woman needs a hospital immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把她抬到圣母像后面 - 这边 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put her in the back of the maraya. - Right lads, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别让我看见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out of my sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该等我发指令的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were supposed to wait for my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我等的话 你就要来收尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had, you'd be clearing up a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,捕风捉影了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and chasing a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,况且雇我的是这姑娘的父母 不是苏格兰场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, the girl's parents hired me, not the Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要请我这个外人帮你 我也不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why they thought you'd require any assistance is beyond me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伦敦城总算能松口气了 - 确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, London will breathe a sigh of relief. - Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜你 雷斯垂德 - 太棒了 督察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Congratulations, Lestrade. - Bravo, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来根雪茄吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:46.51,Default,,0,0,80,,《大侦探福尔摩斯》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,156比80\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}156 over 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的神经这几年已经 好得不能再好了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me nerves have been the best in years, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.55,0:07:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 跟我说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, tell me something:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你的新住所 你什么时候搬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your new premises, when you moving in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,应该一周内就搬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be moving within the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.85,0:07:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,卡文迪许区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cavendish Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那里女人不少哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there will be a womens touch too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 确实啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's marvelous. - Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有人开枪 - 不 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This was gunfire! - No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是用锤子砸钉子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hammer and nail, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.93,0:07:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是我同事 应该是在挂画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My colleagues, probably just... putting up a painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go and check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你同事 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your colleague? - Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会跟你一起搬走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wont be moving with you, will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他不搬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he wont.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:07:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想自己进去 尤其他手上还拿着枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wont go in there by myself. No one has got a gun in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用进去 把报纸给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not need to go in there at all. Give me the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你走了我该怎么办 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will I do when you leave, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他会把整间屋子都拆掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll have the whole house down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他没案子破而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just needs another case, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能再晚点结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't you have a longer engagement?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有火药味 太不象话了 这可是在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smell gunpowder. It's not right you know! Not in a domestic environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 菲利普队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Captain Phillip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,喝点茶压压惊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps a nice cup of tea...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,下周老时间见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same time next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,来 队长 楼下要安静些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Captain. It's quieter downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哈德森太太 给他来点东西提提神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson? Bring something to cheer him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,请求进入军火库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to enter the armoury.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 我在设计一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, I am in the process of inventing a device
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,能减小枪声的装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that depresses the sound of a gunshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,显然你没成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.41,0:08:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我能看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, may I see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,自从上一个案子以来 你有3个月没接案子了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it's been three months, since your last case?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,悠着点 悠着点 华生 别这么狠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gently. Gently, Watson. Be gentle with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得你应该再找件案子来查吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think it's time you found another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到 但 我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't but, agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的脑子受不了这种无所事事的状态 我需要难题 需要工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mind rebels techniques give me problems, give me work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,越快越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sooner the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 报纸 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Paper. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 还有封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see then. There's a letter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是 皇家园林的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,拉姆塞太太寄来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Ramsey, of Queenspark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她丈夫失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her husband's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在比利时呢 还有他的女帮厨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in Belgium, with the scurry maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,已经11月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it November?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Holmes. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 雷德福夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Rathford reports...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,给她的祖母绿项链报了失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her emerald bracelet has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,保险诈骗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An insurance swindle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,雷德福勋爵的马跑得不快 女人倒是换得很勤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Rathford like's fast women and slow ponies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:10:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等布莱克伍德吊死后 你负责验尸吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you're the attending physician, at Blacwood's hanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们最后一次合作的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was our last case together
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望能看到案子最终结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I wanted to see it through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.39,0:10:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个路易斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Mr. Louis...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我此刻只关心一个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one case, that intrigues me at present.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哈德森太太奇案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Curious Case of Mrs. Hudson
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,总是不在的女房东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The absent tea landlady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在观察她的进进出出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been studying her comings and goings
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 实在太诡异了 - 茶水 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and they appear most... sinister. - Tea, Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,下毒了吗 “奶妈”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it poisoned, "Nanny"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经够毒的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's enough of that in you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰 我的东西都摆得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch. Everything is in it's proper place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.12,0:10:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟平时一样 “奶妈”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As per usual, "Nanny".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 他又把狗弄死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, his killed the dog... again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你又对格莱斯顿做什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done to, Gladston now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是测试了下新型麻醉药而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was simply testing a new anesthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,它并不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,作为你的医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as your doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.91,0:10:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它很快就会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be good in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我以一个朋友的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As your friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经在这间屋子待了两星期了 我坚持要你出去走走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been in this room for two weeks. I insist, you have to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,外面的世界都我来说没什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing of interest, for me, out there on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那 你今晚有空吗 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, you're free this evening? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.35,0:11:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一起吃晚饭 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dinner? - Wonderfull.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 皇家餐厅 - 我最喜欢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Royal? - My favourite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没空 - 我要你见见她 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not fair. - You're meeting her, Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你求婚了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you proposed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还没 我还没找到合适的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I haven't found the right ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那就还不算正式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, then it's not official.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这已经是板上钉钉了 不管你赞成与否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's happening, whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上8点半 皇家餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20:30, the Royal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 穿好点 - 你穿好点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where a jacket. - You wear a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你来早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,流行嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fashionably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽·摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Mary Morsten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老天啊 很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my goodness. What a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.81,0:12:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不知道他干嘛要 拖这么久才介绍我们认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the life of me, I don't know why it's taken him so long to introduce us properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是我荣幸才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pleasure is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你 我激动万分 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It really is quite a thrill meeting you, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说了很多你的事迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我家有一大堆侦探小说 柯林斯的 爱伦·坡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a pile of detective novels at home... Collins, Poe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,只是觉得有时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can seem a little
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,通过细枝末节作出惊人推断 有点牵强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}far fetched though, at times. Making these grand assumptions out of tiny details.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也不尽然吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not quite right is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 细枝末节倒是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, the little details are by far, the most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就拿华生来说 - 我也这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take Watson... - I intend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你看他这根手杖 是用稀有的非洲蛇木制成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see this walking stick, a rare African snake wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,藏着把高强钢打造的利刃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiding a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,阿富汗战争时没几个 老兵才能获得的奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Few were rewarded to the veterans of the afgan war,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我推断 他曾是名得过勋章的军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I can assume, he's a decorated soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,坚强 勇敢 天生的冒险家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strong, brave, born to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,又很干练 跟所有军人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and neat, like all military men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,再看看他的口袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I check his pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 一张拳击赛的票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, a stamp from a boxing match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如此说来 他又有点好赌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I can assume he's a bit of a gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是你 就得看好嫁妆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd keep an eye on that dowry, if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是陈年旧事了 - 对 都过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Those days are behind me. - Right, behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好几次把我们的房租都赔进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cost us the rent, more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 你跟约翰本来就很熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well with all due respect, Mr. Holmes, You know John very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是一个完全不认识的陌生人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about a complete stranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.93,0:13:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你能从我身上看出什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can you tell about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你? - 我觉得这有点不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You? - I don't think that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道是不是 - 吃饭的时候就算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know if that's... - Not at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要不下次吧 - 我坚持要这次说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Perhaps another time. - I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你坚持 - 我们讨论过这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You insist? - You remember tht we discussed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是女士坚持的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lady insists
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是名家庭教师 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're a governess. - Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对 很好 要不要 服务生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well done. Shall we... Waiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你的学生 是个8岁的男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your student... It's a boy of eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,其实查理是7岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie is seven, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.31,0:14:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在他这个年龄算是高个子 他今天对你弹墨水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's tall for his age. He flicked you with ink today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我脸上沾到墨水了 - 你的脸没什么不妥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there ink on my face? - There is nothing wrong with your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的耳朵上有两滴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two drops on your ear infact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,印度蓝几乎没法洗掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}India blue is near impossible to wash off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,反正那孩子有点毛躁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, rather impetuous of that boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但作为一名经验丰富的教师 你并没有反应过激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you're to experienced to react rashly, which is why
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那家女主人才会把这副项链借给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the lady for whom you work lent you that necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠 钻石 毫无瑕疵的红宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pearls, diamonds, flawless rubies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不像是家庭女教师穿戴的珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly the gems of a governess .
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.19,0:14:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然而你没戴的首饰反倒透露出更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, the jewls you are not wearing, tell us rather more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯 - 你订过婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holmes! - You were engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,戒指不见了 稍浅的肤色说明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ring has gone, but the lighter skin suggests
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经戴着戒指在国外待过一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you spent some time abroard proudly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但又随后认识到它 并不怎么高的真实价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is until you were informed that it's true
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,于是你毁掉婚约回到英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then you broke of the engagement and returned to, England
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是为一个更好的前途 比如说嫁给一名医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for better prospects. A doctor perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的都没错 福尔摩斯先生 但除了一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right on all accounts Mr. Holmes, apart from one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我并没有抛弃他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,起来打啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.28,0:17:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 大块头 结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢了 恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我们还没打完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oy, we aint done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这时候不能丧失理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must not register on an emotional level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 扰乱对手的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, distract target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,接着挡住他这时候打来的刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then block his blind jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,回一记侧拳 击向对方左脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Counter with cross to the left cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,用双风贯耳扰乱对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Discombobulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他会头晕目眩 胡乱打出一击 这时用肘部抵挡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dazed, he'll attempt a wild hit. employ the elbow block.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后猛击对方身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And body shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来挡住左边的进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}block next left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,肘击右下巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weaken right jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,造成骨折\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now fracture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏右肋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break right ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,造成腹腔神经丛创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traumamatize, solar plexus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,将下巴完全打脱臼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dislocate jaw entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,朝横隔膜猛踹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kick in the diaphragm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,结果如下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In summary:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,下巴骨折 肋骨3根骨裂 4根断裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaw fractured, three ribs cracked four broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,横隔膜内出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}diaphragm haemorrhaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,生理恢复 6星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Physical recovery: 6 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,心理恢复 6个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For psychological recovery: 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.31,0:18:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,向我后脑勺吐口水的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capacity to spit tobacco:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,完全丧失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪一出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.69,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的到底是怎么回事 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on here, Charley?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德像是给他施了咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Blackwood's put him on some kind of spell, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好像他体内有东西要往外烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like he's burning from the inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,查理 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charley. Charley!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,马上把这人抬去医务室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this man to the infirmary! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 布莱克伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this all about then, Blackwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:19:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要见个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's someone I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.83,0:20:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 华生 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watson? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这一开始仅仅是个实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What started as a mere experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如今却带来了一个极具意义的发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has brought me to the threshold of monumental discovery
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我弹半音音阶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if I play, chromatic scale
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's no measurable response.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 你喝的东西是用来做眼部手术的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know, what you're drinking is meant for eye surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这就非常了不起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this is remarkable
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我调到八音簇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I change to eight tone clusters
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voila!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,它们便会沿逆时针方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They fly in counter-clockwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,以同心圆的方式飞舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}synchronized in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.49,0:20:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 这太不寻常了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson this is exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我 运用音乐理论 化无序为有序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, using musical theory, have created order out from chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.31,0:21:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么把它们引进去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you lure them in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一个个地引进去的 我已经弄了有6小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Individually, I've been at it for six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我这样呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what happens if I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己弄干净些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clean yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德的遗愿是要见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are Blackwood's last request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那些塔形结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at those towering structures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是吊桥从未尝试过的组合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first combination of a suspension bridge ever attempted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,非常有创意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most innovative.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们帝国真是勤劳勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an industrious empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我昨晚替你赢了比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I have your winnings from last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你没在 我照你的习惯替你下了注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't there, so I made your customery bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的 我会把这个 和你的支票簿放一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. I'll keep it with your checkbook,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:21:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,安全地锁在我的抽屉里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}locked safely away in my draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道有家歌剧院在演“唐·璜”吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know the opera house is featuring "Don Giovanni"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.75,0:22:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我很容易就能弄两张票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could easily procure a couple of tickets
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,要是今晚你有兴致的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you had any cultural inclinations this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.41,0:22:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,安静是你很大的优点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a grand gift of silence,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.56,0:22:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 作为同伴来说这是相当难得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, it makes you quite invaluable as a companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她订过婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew she'd been engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.66,0:22:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她告诉过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是不去看戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's, no to the opera then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.38,0:22:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的马甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my waistcoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们都认为这太小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we agreed it's too small for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要你放手 - 我想我们意见一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd like it back. - I thought we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,给我放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这边请 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.93,0:23:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德似乎让民众异常狂热啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackwood seems to have got the crowd into some what of a fear frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我想等到他翘辫子 狂热的人会更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure it will disperse once his feet stop twitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.54,0:23:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要一起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Care to come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.18,0:23:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 你自己去吧 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're on your own, old cock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他活着的时候就没我什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no business with him whilst he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,随你的便 “小弟弟”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit yourself, "mother hen".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好像这里还有不少空位啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems you still have lots of rooms to let.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.26,0:23:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是不得已挪开犯人的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to move the prisoners, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.15,0:23:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,否则他们就会闹事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise we're gonna have a riot on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.03,0:23:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他会对囚犯施妖术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a peculiar effect on the inmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像他能进入他们思想一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As though, he can get inside their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.61,0:24:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你有其它事的话 我想自己能过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure I can find my own way if you have other duties to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 先生 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much obliged, sir. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.58,0:24:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我立于海边沙滩之上 看见海水中出现一头怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... and the dragon of the sea. And I saw the beast out of bodies of water
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.47,0:24:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,长有十角七头 角上又戴有十个冠冕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... had ten horns and seven heads, with ten crowns on his horns,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.99,0:24:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,每个头上都有个亵渎神灵的名号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and each head had a blasphemous name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.88,0:24:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们崇拜给予这怪兽力量的古龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And people have glorified ... dragon which he gave the beast
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.35,0:24:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,又崇拜这怪兽 说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to e are glorified and the beast, saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.63,0:24:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谁又跟这兽一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"What is like the beast?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.07,0:24:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这兽长着豹身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beast which I saw has the body of a leopard,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,熊掌及狮口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but had feet of a bear and was the lion's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.87,0:24:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,古龙赐于这兽力量 王位及权威...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dragon gave power unto the beast, his throne and great authority ...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.84,0:24:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你搞的内饰装修\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love what you done to the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.73,0:24:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你接受了我的邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So glad you can accept my invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.58,0:24:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是有点担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have a small point of concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.03,0:24:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么能帮忙的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.04,0:24:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因为感兴趣 我跟进了这系列谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already followed the murders with some intrest...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.04,0:24:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我最初是因为 被害人的家人才接的这案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and although my heart went out primarily to the families of the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.39,0:24:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是无法忽视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't but notice a criminal mastery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.73,0:24:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在背后操控一切的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the stroke of your brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你太客气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.36,0:24:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是相较而言 你的密文绘画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, by comparison, your work in the crypt
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.74,0:24:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,更像是指画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looks more like a finger painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.77,0:25:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你很好奇是不是 还有什么更大的阴谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now you're curious if there's a larger game afoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.74,0:25:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,或者说 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either that or, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.36,0:25:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很快 我朋友要宣布你的死讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shortly my friend, you'll be pronounced dead
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.05,0:25:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是陪着他而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I thought I might keep him company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你错就错在以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mistake is to imagine that anything
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.11,0:25:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,世俗的一切导致如今这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is earthly has led us to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.17,0:25:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你错误的判断在于假设我是主使人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your error of judgment is to assume that I'm holding the brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.39,0:25:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是个引路人而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm merely a channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.35,0:25:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望早点抓住你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only wish is that I could have caught you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.64,0:25:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不会那5个人枉送性命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? Five lives might have been spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.04,0:25:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人的死是必须的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those lives were a necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.10,0:25:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,必要的牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.30,0:25:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还有5条微不足道的性命 将为一个更宏伟的目标做出贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five other wise meaningless creatures called to serve a greater purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.48,0:25:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想他们会不会同意华生和我解剖你的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if they'll let me and Watson dissect your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.21,0:25:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 要等他们先吊死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you hang, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.43,0:25:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我敢打赌 你脑子里的异变 肯定具有重大科学意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd wager, there is some deformity that would be scientifically significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,而你也能为一个更宏伟的目标做出贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you too, could serve a greater purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.81,0:25:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 眼睛睁睁大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, you must widen your gaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.06,0:25:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我担心你低估了接下来要发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm concerned, you underestimate the gravity of coming events.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.59,0:26:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你我注定要开始一段 能改变整个自然结构的历程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I are bound together on a journey that would twist the very fabric of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但在你那充满逻辑的外表下 我嗅到了一丝软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But beneath your mask of logic I sense a frailty...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.55,0:26:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.27,0:26:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,坚强起来 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steal your mind, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.68,0:26:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.03,0:26:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你从上议院成员变作阶下囚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say, you've come a long way down from a house of Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会东山再起 - “一路顺风”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will rise again. - "Bon voyage".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,注意听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还会再死3个 你做什么都救不了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three more will die and there is nothing you can do to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.46,0:26:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你控制不了局势 认命吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must accept that this is beyond your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等你意识到是你让一切成为可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time you realise you made all of this possible
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.41,0:26:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你将彻底发狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will be the last sane thought in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.29,0:26:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他想怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得你们不用跟来 至少这个不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't think you need to follow. Not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.54,0:26:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,亨利·布莱克伍德 你因施展邪术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Henry Blackwood, you are sentenced to death
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.01,0:26:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,杀害五名无辜年轻女子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the practice of black magic
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.36,0:26:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,杀害第六名未遂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the unholy murder of five innocent young women
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.72,0:27:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,被判处死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and an attempted murder of a sixth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.91,0:27:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你有何遗言吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any final words?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.78,0:27:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡 仅仅是开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death... is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.68,0:27:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德已确认死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the end of Lord Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.15,0:28:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦一年的这几天真是阴冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London's so bleak this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.65,0:28:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是我在想新泽西的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I'm pining for New Jersey,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.63,0:28:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是更希望在冬天外出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but much prefer to travel in winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.18,0:28:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你从叙利亚带了点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, I bought you these. All the way from Syria.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.34,0:28:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我从约旦带了些精致的枣子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found these exquisite dates in Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.13,0:28:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你最喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your favorite...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,基克拉迪群岛的橄榄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olives from the Cyclades.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.09,0:28:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们或许能一起开个茶会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we might have a little tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.29,0:28:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,摆桌子的时候我发现了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and while I was setting the table, I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.13,0:28:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一份标有我名字的文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A file with my name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.98,0:28:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,西班牙国王的韦拉斯克斯画像遭窃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The theft of the Velasquez portrait King of Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,海军文档失窃 保加利亚首相引咎辞职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missing naval documents lead to resignation of Bulgarian prime minister
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,由于桃色绯闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scandalous affair ends engagement of... "
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.95,0:29:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哈普斯堡王子 与罗曼诺夫公主的婚约取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Prince Romanov. "of Austria and Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.51,0:29:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在研究你的手法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm simply studying your methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.44,0:29:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果当局要我抓捕你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should the authorities ask me to hunt you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.13,0:29:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没看见文章里有提到我的名字啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't see my name in any of these articles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.55,0:29:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但很明显是你的手法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your signature was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.06,0:29:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是印度王公丢失的钻石吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the Maharaja's missing diamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还是只是个纪念品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or just another souvenir?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.89,0:29:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别总抓着过去不放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not dwell on the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.35,0:29:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.34,0:29:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你现在没案子可办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, by the looks of things, I'd say you were between jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.76,0:29:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在也是没夫君可侍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you between husbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.63,0:29:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,结婚后你得到多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much did you get for the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.87,0:29:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他又无聊又爱吃醋 睡觉还打呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was boring and jealous and he snored.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.14,0:29:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我又变回艾琳·艾德勒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Irene Adler, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.09,0:29:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.87,0:29:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.14,0:30:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,帮忙找个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.72,0:30:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你老是这么多疑干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you always so suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我按照事件的时间顺序 还是首字母顺序回答你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I answer chronologically or alphabetically?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 别被锋利的信封割伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful not to cut yourself on this lethal envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.22,0:30:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道的一切都在信封里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll find all the information inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.95,0:30:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你为谁工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.39,0:30:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我得自己查出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'll have to find out the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.88,0:30:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱收好吧 我没说我会接这案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your money, I didn't say I'll take the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.48,0:30:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就当这是我赌你会接的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it a wager that you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.47,0:30:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得大饭店吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember the Grandl?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.35,0:30:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我还住我们以前那间房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They gave me our old room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我抵着门 谢谢 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the door. Thank's, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.38,0:31:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.51,0:31:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会接的 - 干得好 艾德勒小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'll do it. - Well done, Miss Adler.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.69,0:31:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,正因为这样我才会请你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's precisely why I hired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.74,0:31:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌他会在24小时内把人找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wager, he'll have our man in the next 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.77,0:31:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,最好如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd better.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.43,0:31:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德的所作所为缺不了李奥丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reordan is the key to what Blackwood was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.65,0:31:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我的计划也至关重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's essential to my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 你在干嘛 走路不长眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! What are you doing? Can't you see where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.30,0:31:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.37,0:31:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,带我一程吧 先生 我走了很远的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little ride, I've come along way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.36,0:31:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,脚上都有老茧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.89,0:31:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝拯救女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God save the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.46,0:31:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝拯救女王 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God save the Queen, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.99,0:31:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还不快滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.08,0:32:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.09,0:32:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为何你唯一关心的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is the only woman you've ever cared about
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.55,0:32:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是个江洋大盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a world class criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.98,0:32:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你是受虐狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a masochist?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.06,0:32:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,容我解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me to explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.39,0:32:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.36,0:32:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她是唯一胜过你的敌手 还不止一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the only adversary, who ever out smarted you. Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.39,0:32:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好一个大傻冒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made a proper idiot out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.15,0:32:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,得 你乐呵吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, you've had your fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 话说回来 她要什么 - 现在得坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What she after, anyway? - It's time to press on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.94,0:32:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她会要什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What could she possibly need?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.91,0:32:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.27,0:32:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不在场证明 胡须 还是人肉小船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An alibi, a beard. A human canoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.29,0:32:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她倒是有这个本事 骑着你沿泰晤士河逆流而上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can sit on your back and paddle you up the Thames.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.22,0:32:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 这与你无关 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no consequence to you really, is it Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.14,0:32:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起的最后一个案子已经结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've done our, last case together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.77,0:32:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经看过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.20,0:32:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,寻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missing person.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.04,0:32:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,路克·雷欧登\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luke Reordan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.32,0:32:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,1米47 红棕色头发 没有门牙 案子结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4 foot 10, red hair, no front teeth. Case solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.98,0:32:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她显然不锺意你这一型的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're obviously not her type.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.81,0:32:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她喜欢姜黄色头发的小个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She likes gingered dwarfs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.20,0:32:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那叫侏儒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.20,0:32:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这么说你认可了 - 我不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, you agree. - No, I don't agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.47,0:32:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道 那不只是个术语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more than a technicality, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.17,0:32:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你把矮人的种类搞混了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are misrepresenting the dimensions of short peoples.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.41,0:32:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我多嘴招你厌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've said too much. I can tell, I've upset you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.04,0:32:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我只是想说 那个人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm just simply stating, that one has...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.60,0:33:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我解释吗 - 我倒是想听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you allow me to explain? - I wish you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯 你在干嘛 - 没干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holmes? What are you doing? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.69,0:33:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是戴了 - 假鼻子 没啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you wearing a... - A false nose? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.66,0:33:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那个不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.07,0:33:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 你在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.34,0:33:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Watson!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.94,0:34:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小甜甜 为你准备了些花儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got some flowers for you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.90,0:34:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么漂亮 算你便宜点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut you a deal, cos you're so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.56,0:34:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 真走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.52,0:34:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,美人儿 有东西给我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello gorgeous, you got something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.06,0:34:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.38,0:34:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧这儿是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what have we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.28,0:34:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.73,0:34:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是我认识的艾琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Irene I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.82,0:35:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 我对这个男人很好奇 他把艾琳整得服服贴贴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man Intrigues me, Watson, His got her on the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.39,0:35:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她可不是吃素的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's no mean feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.78,0:35:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她感到威胁 很怕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's intimidated, she's scared of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.36,0:35:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但她还是为他卖命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet she work's for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.18,0:35:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.32,0:35:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不关我事 不过我还是 建议你别插手这个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is nothing to do with me, but I advise you to leave the case alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.34,0:35:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在有的选吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may not always have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.76,0:35:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我有钱自己付房租了 多亏有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, I may be paying the rent on my own soon. Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.55,0:35:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把那玩意儿从我脸上拿开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.69,0:35:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,又不在“你脸上” 在我手里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not "in your face" it's in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.33,0:35:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你手里是啥 给我拿开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get whatever's in your hand out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.58,0:35:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生 - 克拉基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Holmes! - Clarky!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.76,0:36:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了 雷斯垂德警长让您 立刻跟我走一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Inspector Lestrade asks you come with me at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.35,0:36:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这回又怎么了 忘了回苏格兰场的路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he done now, lost his way to Scotland Yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.29,0:36:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 就给他个指南针吧 他需要我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson drop a compass, he needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.60,0:36:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不关我事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you means you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.17,0:36:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 是布莱克伍德 他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Lord Blackwood, sir. He...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.71,0:36:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像又复活了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... it appears he's come back from the grave, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.52,0:36:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真有趣 - 多机灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Most engaging. - Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.52,0:36:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我宣布了他的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pronounced the man dead myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.42,0:36:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are the facts?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.80,0:36:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,墓地管理员说他今天早上 亲眼看见他从墓地里走出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Groundkeeper, claims he saw him walking through the graveyard just this morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.87,0:36:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事就交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll leave this in your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.78,0:36:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我和玛丽有约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an appointment with, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.53,0:36:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是我要名声扫地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my reputation at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.03,0:36:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别来这套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.27,0:36:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 报纸有没有走漏风声 - 我们会尽量收紧口风的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Has the newspaper got wind of it yet. - Well that's what we're trying to avoid, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.42,0:36:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.77,0:36:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在情况如何 - 恐慌 惊恐万分 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the major concern? - Panic. Sheer bloody panic, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.06,0:36:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那是自然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.46,0:36:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 你不会当真了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not taking this seriously, Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.10,0:36:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你也该如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, as you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.55,0:37:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是职业操守的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a matter of professional integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.80,0:37:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有哪个女孩想嫁给一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No girl wants to marry a doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.18,0:37:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是生是死都分不清的医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who can't tell If a man's dead or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉基 你觉得哪个队赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think won the match, Clarky?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.42,0:37:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 球赛呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir? - The rugby match.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.64,0:37:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可是把现场破坏殆尽啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boys have done a magnificent job of obliterating any potential evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.54,0:37:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 不过至少他们不会错过...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but atleats they never miss an opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.04,0:37:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,错失良机的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to miss an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.50,0:37:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 你请自便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took your time, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.97,0:37:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在第三天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on the third day...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.03,0:37:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这些板都是砂岩做的 每个都重达半吨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These slabs are sand stone, they half a ton each
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.82,0:37:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,从里头被砸碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they were smashed open from the inside .
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,雷斯垂德 那棺材呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrade. What of the coffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.71,0:37:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正要把它弄上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are in the process of bringing it up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.55,0:37:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.13,0:38:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,唔 对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.93,0:38:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,正要弄上来 还是在考虑要弄上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At what stage of the process? Contemplative?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.74,0:38:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的证人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how is our witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.73,0:38:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.21,0:38:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,显然他非常紧 紧 紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And apparently he's got ca... ca... ca...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.90,0:38:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catatonic, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.11,0:38:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他有点神志不清 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's not feeling very well. - Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.52,0:38:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你们再这么哆嗦 就等着给我加班吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you lot don't stop behaving like a bunch of quivering milk maids, you're on double time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.52,0:38:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我下去把棺材弄上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you get down there, and you bring that coffin up, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.83,0:38:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,今天还好吗 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.72,0:38:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.14,0:38:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.97,0:38:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他紧张得要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man's in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.68,0:38:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让他再缓缓 - 证人声称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He may need a few moments - The witness states that
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.16,0:38:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他看见布莱克伍德从坟墓里爬了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he saw, lord Blackwood, rise from the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.56,0:38:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如何 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well? - Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.83,0:38:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你宣布他已死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pronounced him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.47,0:39:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有脉搏啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had no pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.62,0:39:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.74,0:39:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不是布莱克伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.45,0:39:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这下证据确凿无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now we have a firm grasp, of the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.78,0:39:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大约两公分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2 thirds of an inch
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.55,0:39:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这么推算死亡时间 应该是在10至12小时之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which would put the time of death at between 10-12 hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.13,0:39:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,能借你笔一用吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I borrow your pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.75,0:40:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有门牙的矮人 - 侏儒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Headless dwarf. - Midget.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.00,0:40:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我看见了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.07,0:40:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是布莱克伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Blackwood!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.92,0:40:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就像看见你们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As clear as I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.10,0:40:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,当死者复生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when the dead walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.47,0:40:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,生者将为之殉葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the living will fill these coffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.77,0:40:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.56,0:40:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好 把盖子合上 现场整理干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, put the lid on and clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.19,0:40:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的相信他复活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really believe he was resurrected?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.19,0:40:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是“怎么”复活的 游戏开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is not "if" but "how." The games afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.56,0:40:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一鼓作气往前直冲吧 一边冲 一边喊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow your spirit and upon this charge cried
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑亨利 英格兰和圣乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}god for Harry, England and St. George.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.63,0:40:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,给 为什么非得是那家鱼和炸薯条店呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are. Why that certain fish and chips store
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.30,0:40:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 - 因为他们使用了一种特殊的啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't understand - Well there's a particular pier
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.59,0:41:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,确切的说 是北方的烈性黑啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they use out in the back, northern stout, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.97,0:41:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Holmes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.45,0:41:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我在战时见过一些无法理解的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen things in war I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.63,0:41:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在印度 我曾经照面过一个 预言自己怎么死的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In India, I once met a man who predicted his own death
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.16,0:41:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹的数量和射中的位置 都精准无误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right down to the number and placement of the bullets that killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.22,0:41:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 你得承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to admit, Holmes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.79,0:41:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在理论上 超自然因素 是可以解释这起案子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a supernatural explanation to this case, is theoretically possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.83,0:41:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.80,0:41:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 没有证据的推理 可是会大错特错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, it is a huge mistake to theorize before one has data.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.45,0:41:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人不可避免地会扭曲事实否定理论 而不是依据理论来判定事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inevitably, one begins to twist facts to shoot theories, instead of theories to shoot facts
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.67,0:41:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That said I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.49,0:41:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个侏儒是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our midget is the key to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.04,0:41:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,手表上弦的孔洞周围有抓痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Scratches around the key hole where the watch is wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.40,0:41:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你得出什么结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.40,0:41:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这人多半是醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man was most likely a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.21,0:41:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,每次上弦 手滑了 所以有了抓痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time he wound the watch, his hand slipped, hence the scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.15,0:41:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes Very good, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.84,0:41:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你的推理能力已经相当了得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have developed considerable deductive powers of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.37,0:41:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再来看看 有几个姓名缩写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see now. There are several sets of initials.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.77,0:41:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 皮条客的记号 - 真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Porn brokers marks. - Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.38,0:41:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,最近的一个是M.H. M.H. M.H.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most recent of which are: "M.H. M.H. M.H...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.37,0:42:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- M.H.是指 - Maddison和Haig\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- M.H is for... - "Maddison and Haig.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.25,0:42:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以告诉我们地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They should be able to give us an address.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.60,0:42:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.46,0:42:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事你忘了推理 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one thing you failed to deduce from the watch, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.94,0:42:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.71,0:42:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,表上的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.62,0:42:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我得回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get back, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.05,0:42:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,和亲家喝个茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking tea with the in-laws..
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.43,0:42:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先生 我能给你看相吗 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I predict your future, sir? - Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.79,0:42:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 谢了 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.91,0:42:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你得听我说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to hear what I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.25,0:42:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,吉普赛女郎 我们不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no need of your lucky heather Gypsy women.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.59,0:42:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是和玛丽有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if it's to do with Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.65,0:42:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见两个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.60,0:42:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,两兄弟 没有血缘关系 不过关系很铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brothers. Not in blood, but in boned.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.76,0:42:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What of Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.88,0:42:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,M代表玛丽 指婚姻 噢 你们会结婚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M for Mary, for marriage. Oh, you will be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.88,0:42:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.61,0:43:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见各式图案的桌布 还有瓷做的雕塑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see patterned table cloths and china figurines.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.80,0:43:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,和蕾丝桌巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lace doilies...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.13,0:43:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,桌巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doilies...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.54,0:43:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lace doilies...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.51,0:43:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,桌巾 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doilies... Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.19,0:43:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这人竟无耻到这个地步了 - 不关我的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Does your depravity know, no bounds? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.05,0:43:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她发胖了 还长胡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh she turns fat and has a beard...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.33,0:43:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,皮疣呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what of the warts?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.48,0:43:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 满身皮疣 - 够了 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She is covered in warts... - Enough, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.36,0:43:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有很多吗? - 可以了 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are they extensive? - Please, enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.59,0:43:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是芙劳若多年来最准的预言了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the most apt prediction, Flora's made in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.81,0:43:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也正因如此 你找不到一枚合适的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And precisely the reason you can't find a suitable ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.79,0:43:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我的钱在你身上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.78,0:43:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕悲剧的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are terrified of a life without the thrill of a macabre.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.17,0:43:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我那份在身上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have my cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.32,0:43:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 承认吧 承认吧 - 把钱给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Admit it, admit it! - Give me my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.95,0:43:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.73,0:43:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.61,0:43:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.69,0:43:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这下可好 你买了戒指 我有了那侏儒的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you've got your ring, and I've got the address for my ginger midget.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.91,0:43:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,应该就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should be just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.89,0:44:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她定会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she'll really like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.67,0:44:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有富余\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have some change in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.24,0:44:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要我替你看着吗 - 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should I look after it for you? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.04,0:44:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别在这儿赌输了 - 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't give it away here. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.39,0:44:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去见玛丽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go see Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.42,0:44:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,替我问候她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give them my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.18,0:44:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还有她的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the family as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.35,0:45:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有个完全信得过的人在身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does make a considerable difference to me, having someone with me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.54,0:45:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,确实不一样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on whom I can throughly rely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.77,0:45:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能留给你十分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can rely on me for exactly 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.02,0:45:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他清楚有人会来找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He clearly fely something was coming to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.73,0:45:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,已经来过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or something did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.36,0:45:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是艾琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irene was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.30,0:45:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要么就是那侏儒和她用同一款巴黎香水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}either that or the ginger midget wore the same Parisian perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.37,0:45:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 腐败味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, putrefaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.43,0:45:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,硫氨酸 还混杂着其它气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ammonium sulphate, among other aromas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.09,0:45:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,磷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phosphorus.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.06,0:45:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,甲醛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Formaldehyde.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.46,0:46:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他是打算把巫术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like he was attempting to combine
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.87,0:46:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,和化学方程式结合起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some kind of sorcery and scientific formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.13,0:46:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.49,0:46:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他打算处理掉的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What he was trying to dispose of.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.32,0:46:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,钾和镁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Potassium and magnesium.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.70,0:46:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,硫酸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sulfuric acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.09,0:46:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只要没烧完 墨迹里头就有铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the iron went out of the ink as long as it's not to burnt
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.98,0:46:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.76,0:46:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,水合杜鹃花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydrated rhododendron.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.09,0:47:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 瞧这个图案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes. Look at the crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.20,0:47:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,李奥丹和布莱克伍德是一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reordan was working with, Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.25,0:47:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那是当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.99,0:47:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是什么目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Question is, to what end.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.27,0:47:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他在搞什么 显然成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever he was working on, clearly suceeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.76,0:47:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.23,0:47:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不然他还死不了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, he'd still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.63,0:47:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,所以艾德勒小姐才会急于要找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why Miss Adler is so desperate to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.34,0:47:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.03,0:47:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一样东西没闻出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I can't quite put my finger on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,棉花糖 糖浆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it candy floss? Molasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.70,0:47:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,枫蜜 啊 大麦糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maple syrup. Ah, barley sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.76,0:47:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太妃苹果(左边打手手里拿的)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toffee apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.96,0:47:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.45,0:48:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看你们这身行头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judging by your arsonist tool kit
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.17,0:48:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是来烧房子销毁证据的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here to burn down the building and estinguish all the evidence therein
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.13,0:48:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等片刻 小子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one minute boys..
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.44,0:48:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 Draga\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Draga!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.64,0:48:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.12,0:48:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meat...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.47,0:48:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还是土豆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.65,0:48:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My 10 minutes are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.67,0:49:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.92,0:49:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不赶时间
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.92,0:49:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.46,0:50:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.93,0:50:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.73,0:50:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.53,0:50:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.26,0:51:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谁派你来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.72,0:51:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你清楚得很
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.35,0:52:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,替个死人干活
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.39,0:52:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.98,0:52:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他死而复生了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.56,0:52:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不管有没有复活
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.48,0:52:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.69,0:52:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,比起你和你的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.40,0:52:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事值得敬畏多了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.25,0:52:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小兔崽子 跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.42,0:52:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.57,0:54:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.68,0:55:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.52,0:55:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你都干了些什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.70,0:55:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我整夜没睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't slept all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.70,0:55:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,眨都没眨一眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a whink.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.92,0:55:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why I ever believed...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.45,0:55:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不去和亲家喝茶 反而\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I would get to have tea with Mary's parents? is beyond me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.18,0:55:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,被你说服跟你走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}having been talked into going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.44,0:55:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遇袭了 伙计 那是自卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were set upon man, it was self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.69,0:55:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我看了我的笔记 里头有我们过去七个月的丰功伟绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been reviewing my notes, of our exploits over the last seven months.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.35,0:55:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我得出什么结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you like to know my conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.20,0:55:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我脑子绝对是进水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am psychologically disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.87,0:55:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你故意不让我知道你的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why else would I be continually led into situations
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.11,0:56:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么还傻乎乎跟着你跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you delibrately, withhold your plans from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.02,0:56:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why else?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.48,0:56:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前可没抱怨过我的作风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never complained about my methods before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.01,0:56:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是抱怨 - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not complaining. - You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.77,0:56:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you call this? - How...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.86,0:56:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪儿抱怨了 我从不呛声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I complaining? I never complain, when do I
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.75,0:56:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你半夜三更练琴我有抱怨过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever complain about you practicing the violin at three in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.54,0:56:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你不讲卫生 把屋子搞得一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or your mess, your general lack of hygiene
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.00,0:56:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还偷走我所有衣服我有抱怨过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the fact that you steal all my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.65,0:56:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说好了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a barter system.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.87,0:56:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你朝我屋子放火我有抱怨过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do I complain about you setting fire to my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.61,0:56:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的屋子 - 那些屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our rooms. - The rooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.84,0:56:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿我的狗当实验品我抱怨过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do I ever complain that you experiment on my dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.62,0:56:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是我们的狗 - 看你干的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our dog! It's our dog. - On the... the dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.54,0:56:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你还破坏我和玛丽的感情 我很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do take issue, is your campaign to sabatage my relationship to Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.34,0:56:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.00,0:56:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You do? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.85,0:56:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你理解个屁 - 你太累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think you do. - You're overly tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.79,0:56:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你有点太敏感了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - You're feeling a bit sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.82,0:56:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.12,0:56:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要好好休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you need is to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.35,0:56:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥迈克罗夫特 在奇切斯特附近有个小庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother, Mycroft, has a small estate near Chichester.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.16,0:56:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,美丽的草坪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautifull grounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.12,0:57:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱哥俩去好好享受下 - 咱们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We could throw a land on the spit... - We?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.91,0:57:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 就算是去郊游 我也是和未婚妻一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, if I were to go to the country it would be with my future wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.44,0:57:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 如果你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well certainly, if you must...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.81,0:57:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我和玛丽去 没你啥事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No not you, Mary and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.98,0:57:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你 - 我不受欢迎吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are not... - What? Invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.15,0:57:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我去我亲哥的庄园小憩都不成吗 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I be not invited to my own brothers country home, Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.20,0:57:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还讲不讲道理啊 - 你个非人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now you are not making any sense! - You're not human!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.70,0:57:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰·华生 - 在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- John Watson? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.83,0:57:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你被保释了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bail has been posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.61,0:57:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.51,0:57:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没你的份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.01,0:57:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好能在早餐前被保出去 我的兄弟们都饿坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you get bail by breakfast, because my boys, are getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.22,0:57:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.18,0:58:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,侍者说“我可以拉下您的凳子吗”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To which the barman says: "may I push in your stool?".
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.49,0:58:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right you, you're out..
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.93,0:58:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下次继续讲 - 很荣幸 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Until next time. - It's always a pleasure, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.06,0:58:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你来得真及时 雷斯垂德 我快没笑话可讲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you're here, Lestrade I'd almost ran out of jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.71,0:58:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你上辈子肯定是个罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In another life, you'd have made an excellent criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.78,0:58:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是名出色的警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir and you an excellent policemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.33,0:58:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomsky 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomsky! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.81,0:58:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以解释一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now please tell me you have answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.39,0:58:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,适当的时候 雷斯垂德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in good time, Lestrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.74,0:58:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,适当的时候 为什么非要我们 猜你在想些啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in good time? what is this some parlour game where we have to guess what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.19,0:58:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,恐慌的公众要求知情权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a public in frenzy out there
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.94,0:58:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不尽快查明真相的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if you don't fill me in,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.08,0:58:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把你扔回去和那些赌徒玩个够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have you in there playing Victoria and Albert quicker than a bookies runner
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.39,0:58:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己弄干净点 好去见人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, clean up and make yourself presentable.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.61,0:58:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要见谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.92,0:58:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,上头来人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends in high places.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.43,0:58:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们把你保出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the ones who bailed you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.53,0:59:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm terribly sorry to inconvene you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.85,0:59:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你必须戴上头罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm going to have to put this on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.00,0:59:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 很抱歉 用这种方式把你请来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, apologies for summoning you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.78,0:59:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很想知道自己在哪 以及我的身份吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure it's quite a mystery as to where you are and who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.79,0:59:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,关于我在哪这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As to where I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.67,0:59:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,经过查宁路口和霍尔博街的时候 我确实有些分不清方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was admitedly lost for a moment, between Charing Cross and Holborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.19,0:59:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但经过南福特山的面包店时 我又搞清楚了方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was saved by the Bread shop on Southford Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.77,0:59:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,只有那个店会在面包里放入 某种特殊的法国奶浆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only baker to use the certain french glaze on a sage
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.99,0:59:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,随后马车又左右颠簸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after that the carriage fought left and right
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.74,0:59:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,来到了舰队街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until bump the Fleet conduit
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.49,0:59:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,至于你的身份嘛 思考这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as to who you are? that took every ounce of my not
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.52,0:59:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,倒费了一些心思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inconsiderable experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.07,0:59:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你桌上的信是寄给托马斯先生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The letters on your desk were addressed to a Sir Thomas Rodrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.35,0:59:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他是首席法官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Chief Justice. That would be the official title
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.99,0:59:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,至于你是谁 就是另一个问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you really are... is of course another matter entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.40,0:59:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,从你戒指上的圣牛图来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judging by the sacred ox on your ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.36,0:59:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是四圣会的神秘头目吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the secret head of the Temple of the Four Orders
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.62,0:59:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿就是总部所在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in who's headquarters we now sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.90,0:59:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,应该在圣詹姆斯广场的西北角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Located, north-west corner St. James square I think
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.37,1:00:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我全都知道了 为啥还费心蒙我眼睛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the mystery, the only mystery is to why you bothered to blind fold me at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.02,1:00:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 照章办事罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes... well, standard procedure I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.17,1:00:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找对人了 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare say we have the right man, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.99,1:00:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,歇洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.84,1:00:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,美国大使史坦迪 以及内政大臣柯瓦德阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U.S. Ambassador Standish and Lord Coward, the home secetary.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.06,1:00:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你一定知道我们组织的一些情况吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose you already have some notion as to the practices of our order.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.57,1:00:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 非常有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. They are practically intresting.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.03,1:00:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以持怀疑态度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be as sceptical as you like.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.10,1:00:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但几百年来 我们的这个秘密组织 为世界和平做出了巨大的贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but our secret system has steered the world to good for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.77,1:00:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,危险在于 它也可以助纣为虐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There danger is they can also be used for more nefarious purposes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.18,1:00:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有人称之为“黑暗艺术” 或是“真实的魔法”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What some call the dark arts or practical magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.49,1:00:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你不相信魔法 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know you don't believe in magic Mr. Holmes
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.05,1:00:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,也不指望你理解我们的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't expect you to share our faith
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.84,1:00:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但请理解我们的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}merely our fears.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.20,1:00:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下 恐惧这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fear is the most infectious condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.20,1:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是最具传染性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this instance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.48,1:00:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,您是对自己孩子的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fear of your own child.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.56,1:01:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德是您儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackwood is your son
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.46,1:01:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩有着一样的虹膜 罕见的深绿色 钻石状的淡褐色花线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the same irises, a rare dark green, the diamond shaped hazel flex
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.00,1:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还有着一样的外耳 这是直系血亲才会遗传的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}together with the identical outer ears or pinner, which are only past down through direct blood line
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.91,1:01:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which makes by necessity either brothers
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.64,1:01:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在看来 父子关系更为可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or in this case, more likely father and son.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.56,1:01:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很少有人知道这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very few people have paraded that information.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.90,1:01:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'd want to keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.74,1:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他是在组织的仪式上怀上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was concieved during one of our rituals.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.75,1:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他母亲不是我妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His mother wasn't my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.29,1:01:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她有着同样的信仰 也是一名出色的法师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she shared our beliefs. She was a powerfull practitioner.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.17,1:01:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她生下孩子后就去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though not enough to survive giving birth to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.00,1:01:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他在各处散播死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death followed him where ever he went.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.07,1:01:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那五个女孩并不是唯一的牺牲品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those five girls were not the first to be butchered.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.48,1:01:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了很多女孩来增强自己力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed many more to use them to enhance his powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.38,1:01:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 没有证人 但我们知道一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one could prove anything of course, but we already knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.70,1:02:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个祸害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy was a curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.79,1:02:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们尝试过阻止他 但无济于事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd done our best to stop him ourselves, but its not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.39,1:02:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他的力量日益增长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His power grows daily.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.81,1:02:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,复活就是证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His resurection is evidence of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.84,1:02:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他接下来要做的将更为危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what he does next will be far more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.28,1:02:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密都在这本咒书中 这是他能量的来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secret lies in the book of spells. This is the source of his power.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.20,1:02:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他要召唤神秘力量 改变这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His going to raise a force that will alter the very course of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.35,1:02:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to find him and stop him before he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.86,1:02:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将提供你所需的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll give you any assisatnce that we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.17,1:02:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,作为内政大臣 我有权力调动警力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As home secretary, I have a considerable influence over the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.71,1:02:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我明白 - 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yes - So...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.91,1:02:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,开个价吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name your price?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.99,1:02:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我现在是给各位做顾问 我就有权选择顾客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well a great benefit to the social deficit. I, can pick and choose my clients.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.93,1:02:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个案子 我接了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it done, I'll stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.48,1:02:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 不是为了你 也不会开什么价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not for you. And certainly not for a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.61,1:02:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒有个疑问 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do have a parting query sir, Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.46,1:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.52,1:03:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他其它的亲人都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We the rest of his family dead...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.90,1:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能活多久呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how long do you expect to survive?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.78,1:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好好想想吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food for thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.06,1:03:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你开这个会更在行些吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well perhaps you'll have better luck opening that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.75,1:03:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Margot 58 彗星葡萄酒啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Margot '58. comet vintage.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.50,1:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好神奇啊 彗星还会影响酒的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fascinating that a astronomical event can effect the quality...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.47,1:03:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那件拜托你的案子咋样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it going with our case that you refused to take.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.56,1:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,酒的质量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.82,1:03:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我进死胡同了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or I've hit a dead end. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.10,1:03:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找的人被埋在布莱克伍德的坟墓里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found your man. He's buried in Blackwood's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.13,1:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还要继续查吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you still need him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.53,1:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh dear...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.53,1:04:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,希望顾客不会来要求我退钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope my client doesn't come looking for a refund.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.89,1:04:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的顾客是位教授吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a professor, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.67,1:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看到正脸 但看到衣服上的粉笔灰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't see his face, but I spotted a bit of chalk on his tappan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.64,1:04:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不知道有哪位教授 会随身带一把如此精致的手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never known a professor to carry a gun, and on such a clever contraption.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.58,1:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,原来戴眼罩的是你 厉害...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyepatch. Nice touch...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.95,1:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那么案子结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... case closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.28,1:04:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你现在只是顺路过来拜访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which makes this a social visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.54,1:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是来告诉你 事情已经非你所能掌控 艾琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's you're in over your head Irene, visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.11,1:04:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,杀害李奥丹的凶手有意隐藏行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who ever killed, Reardon they were covering their tracks,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.67,1:04:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是他们的下一个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which means that you're the next loose end that needs to be snipped.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.99,1:04:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.77,1:04:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我搞不定的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been in over my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.80,1:04:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,远走高飞吧 那是你最擅长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave now, dissapear. You're good at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.55,1:04:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,留下来的话最好接受安全保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or stay. And volunteer for protective custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.93,1:04:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我有危险 你也逃不掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm in danger, so are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.73,1:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.15,1:05:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就彼此信任一回 行不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we trusted each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.78,1:05:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我要带你去火车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not listening. I'm taking you, to either a railway station
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.34,1:05:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,或是警察局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the policestation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.53,1:05:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.84,1:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你选哪个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.98,1:05:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你来决定吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You decide, which will it be?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.88,1:05:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,让你放松些嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to let it breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.76,1:05:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尝到彗星的味道了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you taste the comet?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.74,1:05:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为啥不跟我一起走呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why couldn't you just come away with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.89,1:07:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,女士 请保持冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam, I need you to remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.73,1:07:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我不是坏人 这个枕头底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, I'm a professional. but underneath this pillow
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.46,1:07:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,藏着能让我自由的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lies the key to my release.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.71,1:07:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她完全误会了我的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, she misinterpreted my intention entirely.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.24,1:07:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 人之常情嘛 - 所以我觉得现代宗教狂热很烦人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Naturally sir. - Thats why I find this modern religious fellow so troubling.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.56,1:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就不包容误会嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no latitude for misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.36,1:08:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别满嘴跑火车了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It runs right over reason, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.59,1:08:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,侍女曾经是很善解人意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And chambermaids were once such a liberal breed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.30,1:08:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我妻子就曾经当过侍女 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife's a chambermaid, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.35,1:08:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还好 她对你还算客气 要不我们就不可能找到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhow, it's a good thing she was a friend, otherwise we may never have found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.55,1:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,警长一整个早上都呆在贝克街呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inspector's been over at Baker Street himself this morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.02,1:08:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我妻子的事 只是开个玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just joking about the wife, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.81,1:08:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们检查过了 门窗没有被撬开的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've checked everything. There's no sign of a break in
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.37,1:08:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,管家也没听到什么异样声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the butler didn't hear a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.24,1:08:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体在浴缸里 死不瞑目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So body in the bath tub, his eyes were wide open
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.31,1:08:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一失踪的东西是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the only thing missing was...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.47,1:08:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His ring, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.69,1:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛要把水放干啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you drain the water?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.77,1:09:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对死者的尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of common decency.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.07,1:09:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,罪犯当道 请保持理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crime is common. Logic, is rare.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.45,1:09:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该做的是捉住罪犯 而不是安慰一具尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The decent thing to do is catch the killer, not to provide conflict to the cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.33,1:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.23,1:09:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是茉莉浴盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jasmine bath salt, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.48,1:09:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那原本应该是装在一个大容器里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Super. Probably comes from a larger container.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.42,1:09:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是放在储藏室里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would either be in the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.55,1:09:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,温暖又干燥的地方 或是放在有通风口的柜橱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High up where it's warm and dry. Or in a linen cupboard with a vent.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.62,1:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,警官 你最好检查一下后窗那块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh and constable, you could do worse than to check the
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.31,1:09:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看有没有脚印啥的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ground under the rear window for any signs of footprints
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.95,1:09:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,线索 线索 线索 没线索我咋办案啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}data, data, data. I can not make bricks without clay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.40,1:10:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charles?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.27,1:10:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在柜橱还是储藏室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it in the cupboard or the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.74,1:10:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在储藏室找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was in the pantry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.96,1:11:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意用啥做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to make of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.01,1:11:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,匠心独运啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wxcellent work.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.12,1:11:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adieu.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.10,1:11:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么 柯瓦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the meaning of this, Coward?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.29,1:11:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛要开这个会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why have you called this meeting?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.26,1:11:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯爵士死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Thomas is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.73,1:11:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我提名布莱克伍德为四圣会领导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I nominate Lord Blackwood as head of the Order.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.70,1:12:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.07,1:12:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道不知道他的可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know damn well what his capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.45,1:12:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.98,1:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以咱们才会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.26,1:12:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,全体聚集于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why, we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.99,1:12:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的力量和财产 均是为了一个目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My powers and my assets were given to me for one purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.00,1:12:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,荣华富贵只是表面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent was a simple purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.18,1:12:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要开创新的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To create a new future.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.95,1:12:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,由我们统治的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A future ruled... by us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.42,1:12:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,明天正午 我们将谱写新的历史篇章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow at noon, we take the first step towards a new chapter in our history.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.90,1:12:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,魔术将引领我们前行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.83,1:12:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦英格兰人民见识到我们的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the people of England see our new found power
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.80,1:12:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都会臣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll bow down in fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.93,1:12:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大西洋那边 有一块大陆曾是我们的殖民地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Across the Atlantic, lies a colony that was once ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.96,1:13:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要收复失地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be again.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.20,1:13:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,南北战争使他们内耗严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The civil war has made them weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.59,1:13:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的政府和英国的一样 腐败无能 效率低下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their government is as corrupt and ineffective as ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.87,1:13:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把它收回是天经地义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we'll take it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.63,1:13:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要重新创造世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will remake the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.64,1:13:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,开创未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Create the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.94,1:13:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人都支持我 Standish\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These men are with me, Standish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.56,1:13:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.38,1:13:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你想 都别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. I am not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.25,1:13:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These powers that you're playing with...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.38,1:13:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能控制得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no man, can control.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.47,1:13:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们 虽然你们不想 但必须有人阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well gentlemen... Someone has to stop them
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.37,1:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你逃不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if you won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.31,1:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是你 就不会开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.76,1:14:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen... don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.33,1:14:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有神力护体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, we are protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.91,1:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请歃酒为盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come... drink your allegience here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.80,1:14:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你有权调动警察 把他们都利用起来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You control the police, now use them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.30,1:14:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.71,1:14:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这房间不是你的了 介意我使用一下不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since this room is no longer yours, do you mind if I utilise it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.02,1:14:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,随意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.17,1:14:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 进来吧 - 把他放哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In here chaps. - Where shall we put him, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.95,1:15:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,随你们怎么放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anywhere's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.19,1:15:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.44,1:15:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在李奥丹房间里想杀你的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His the one who tried to kill you at Reardon's lodgings.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.78,1:15:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他Draga被撞断了脖子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose his neck didn't survive the impact of Draga landing on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.12,1:15:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你那次救了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes... Thanks for that by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.12,1:15:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,庆幸的是 这家伙的尸体还有些用途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is still some consolation in the knowledge that he can still be of service to his fellow man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.59,1:15:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,肘上沾着血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elbow is now stained with blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.46,1:15:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是他受伤之前沾上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's older than his own injuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.19,1:15:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不是动物的血 也不是人的血...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if it's not human. There's an odd butcher. Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.87,1:16:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,黄色火焰 绿色灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow Flame. Green bursts.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.62,1:16:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个工厂工人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An industrial worker.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.49,1:16:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有煤炭和淤泥的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coal. Hint of silt.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.94,1:16:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,裤子上的污渍 说明他是在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the stains on his trousers, should put him squarely in...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.23,1:16:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,九榆树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine Elms.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.88,1:16:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry what?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.91,1:16:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找的地方是 九榆树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The area you're looking for is, Nine Elms.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.43,1:16:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得我把那本书放哪了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember where I put the Lord's registerer of members intrests?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.78,1:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在梯子上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the step ladder.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.21,1:16:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德在腐蚀人们的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackwood was involved in everything that's corrosive to the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.78,1:16:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Woolidge军火库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woolidge Arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.52,1:16:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,莱姆豪斯化学工厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Limehouse Chemical Works.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.02,1:16:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很可能是河边的一家工厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably be a factory by the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.22,1:16:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.17,1:16:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当我没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.58,1:16:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我的橄榄球在哪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know where my rugby ball went do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.92,1:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.61,1:16:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,昆斯亥特屠宰场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queensithe slaughterhouse
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.55,1:16:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,九榆树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine Elms.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.34,1:17:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一家在河边的工厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A factory by the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.85,1:17:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 华生 我们会找到布莱克伍德的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Watson. That should lead us right to Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.90,1:17:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,活要见人 死要见尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead or Alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.11,1:17:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是“我们”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.12,1:17:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是“你”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.32,1:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.17,1:17:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,继续咬文嚼字吧 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a figure of speech, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.50,1:17:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他故意留下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's left it there on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.84,1:17:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,再加点煤 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More coal doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.84,1:17:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真不赖啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.84,1:18:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴看见你们在“努力工作”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad to see you two are working hard then.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.29,1:18:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别闲着好不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought you were trying to be discrete.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.82,1:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你在海军一天都干不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would not last one day in the navy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.07,1:18:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 你确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, are you sure that there is no
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.02,1:18:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你能找到的最好的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alternative means of water transportaion, than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.87,1:18:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我敢打赌 没人比他更熟悉伦敦的水路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guarantee you nobody knows London's waterways better.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.85,1:18:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanners简直就是一条鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanners practically a fish himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.23,1:18:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他醉醺醺的样子确实像鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least he certainly drinks like one.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.53,1:18:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,挺幽默的嘛 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh you've found your sense of humour, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.85,1:18:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过太损人啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only just a sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.48,1:18:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我来吧 这活儿还是有诀窍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I better take over. A bit tricky down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.69,1:18:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.90,1:19:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 似曾相识 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look familiar? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.63,1:19:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,少了个侏儒而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that's missing is a ginger midget.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.63,1:19:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们清理了些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cleared something away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.07,1:19:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有段时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.37,1:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啥东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.10,1:19:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不清楚 可能是些机械吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure. Something mechanical.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.31,1:19:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.33,1:20:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1:18 - 代表“章”和“节”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 1:18 - Chapter and verse.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.17,1:20:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,启示录第1章18节 我是存活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revelations. 1:18. "I am here liveth
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.21,1:20:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又是死亡的 - 我存活的时候更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and was dead." - And behold of the life for ever more.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.91,1:20:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告你 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you, Holmes to accept
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.83,1:20:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你能控制得了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this was beyond your control.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.61,1:20:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是你那凡人的脑子所能理解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what your rational mind could comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.02,1:20:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的“来世”吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if this, is the after life that you're having.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.64,1:20:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你成为见证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to bear witness.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.51,1:20:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,明天正午 你所认识的世界将会灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, at midday, the world as you know it, will end.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.43,1:20:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢不敢现身 我现在就灭了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me your face and it will be the end of your qorld right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.07,1:20:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,节约子弹 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save the bullets, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.81,1:20:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,送你份小礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.09,1:20:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才谁说节约子弹来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that about saving bullets?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.88,1:20:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟踪你来到这 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She followed you here, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.83,1:20:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,想眼睁睁看着小羊羔被屠宰吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You reared your lamb to slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.73,1:21:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,接着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.53,1:21:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 别伤着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This game was designed to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.08,1:21:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.70,1:21:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还很热 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's warm in here, Watson!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.36,1:21:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,超过你能力范围了吗 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In over your head yet, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.79,1:21:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坚持住 - 我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on there! - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.64,1:21:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让我帮你减轻点重量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me take your weight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.34,1:21:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把腿伸直了 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the leg up, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.72,1:21:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直搞不定这种吊锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These jamming locks always give me trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.06,1:21:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿这把锯子并不锋利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To bad a saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.23,1:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我们有的是时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter. We have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.05,1:22:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.26,1:22:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这没效果啊 - 保持冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not working. - Keep calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.92,1:22:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes! Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.63,1:22:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not getting excited...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.21,1:22:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,去把阀门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn of that valve.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.71,1:23:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听我倒数 往下压 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we bounce in... Three
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.49,1:23:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...two,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.20,1:23:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.88,1:23:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.15,1:23:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我去追布莱克伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get after, Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.60,1:23:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.47,1:23:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该去帮医生的忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go help the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.98,1:23:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.11,1:25:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 柯瓦德签发了逮捕令要抓你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord. Coward has issued a warrant for your arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.56,1:25:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,华生还活着 离开这 先生 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson's alive. Just get out of here, sir. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.76,1:26:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,火车会准点开吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will the train be departing on time?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.19,1:26:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,晚点了 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The train's been delayed, madam.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.88,1:26:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但应该不会太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't be long now though.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.41,1:26:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只有得到我的首肯火车才会开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The train will depart when I tell it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.39,1:26:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要离任也需得到我的允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you will leave my employment, when I allow you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.02,1:26:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经履行了契约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fulfilled my contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.64,1:26:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到李奥丹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found Reorden.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.18,1:26:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他在苏格兰场的停尸间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in Scotland Yard's mortuary.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.45,1:26:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我完成我的工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's me finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.26,1:27:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工作是操控福尔摩斯对你的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your job was to munipulate, Holmes' feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.23,1:27:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是屈从于他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not succomb to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.76,1:27:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全没有没履行你的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have fulfilled nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.80,1:27:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要李奥丹给布莱克伍德制作的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want what, Reardon was making for Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.97,1:27:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,完成你的工作 不然下一个死的将是歇洛克?福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}finish the job, or the next dead body will be of Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.20,1:27:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,外科医生应该很快就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The surgeon should be along shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.99,1:27:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在应该能好好休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should be able to rest now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.24,1:27:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.77,1:28:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你这就竭尽全力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.87,1:28:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,目前来说是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.03,1:28:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去照顾其它病人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must attend to my other patients.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.65,1:28:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.62,1:28:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.21,1:28:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.55,1:28:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你和我一样关心他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that you care for him as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.94,1:28:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的责任 这是他自己的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not your responsibility, It was his choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.30,1:28:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他说受这伤是值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd say it was worth the wounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.59,1:28:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,解决好这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solve this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.22,1:28:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不计任何代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.64,1:28:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是布莱克伍德 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Lord Blackwood, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.42,1:29:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么我做不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been in over my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.43,1:29:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这虽与我无关 但我建议你别管这案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing to do with me, but I'd advise you to leave the case alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.92,1:29:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你并没认真对待此事 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not taking this seriously are you, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.86,1:29:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 这事远远超过了你的能力范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to accept, his was belond your control
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.49,1:29:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,明日正午 世界将于此刻终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow at mid-day, the world will end.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.74,1:29:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.32,1:29:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我 踏入一场 即将扭转世界的漫漫旅程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I, are bound on a journey that will twist the very fabric of nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.34,1:29:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好好想清楚 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steal your mind, "Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.56,1:29:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他将召唤出一股 能彻底改变世界的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will raise a force that will change the very course of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.38,1:29:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他的力量会增长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His power grows.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.69,1:29:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他力量的来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the source of his power.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.10,1:29:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.18,1:29:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密就藏在魔法书之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secret lies in the book of spells.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.19,1:30:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还将有三人死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three more will die...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.51,1:30:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何你救不了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's nothing you can do to save them.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.86,1:30:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你不相信魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know you don't believe in magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.59,1:30:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,李奥丹在和布莱克伍德合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reardon was working with Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.05,1:30:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一不见的是他的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing missing was his ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.60,1:30:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give up, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.28,1:30:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个谜题你解答不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a riddle you can not solve.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.23,1:31:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.00,1:31:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你得工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you need to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.57,1:31:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这副图看起来眼熟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Familliar artwork?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.23,1:31:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.78,1:31:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你不会走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some how, I knew you wouldn't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.89,1:31:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你上了报纸头版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made the front page.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.09,1:31:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只有名字 没登照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a name, and no picture?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.91,1:31:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你需要边躲避司法边工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it looks like, you'll be needing to work outside the law now,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.97,1:31:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我的专长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's my area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.32,1:31:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经感觉安全多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel safer already.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.73,1:31:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来恢复得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to be making a rapid recoverey.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.11,1:31:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.07,1:31:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己把弹片取出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took this shrapnel out myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.64,1:31:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽说给我看病的医生很差劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary said I had a lousy doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.90,1:32:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I'm... I'm just so...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.30,1:32:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你 能和我们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very glad that you're um... well, with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.90,1:32:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你已经舒舒服服的坐好了 那我就要开始说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that you're sitting comfortably, I shall begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.43,1:32:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我起初的调查面太狭隘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My initial approach was far to narrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.67,1:32:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德邀请我去 本顿维尔监狱的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Blackwood invited me to Pentonville prison
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.73,1:32:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他建议我扩宽眼界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he suggested I widen my gaze.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.59,1:32:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我刚刚做到了这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and at minimum, I have done just that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.78,1:32:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 我可能刚刚解决了 上千年来神学研究上的分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I may well have reconciled thousand's of years of theological disparities.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.24,1:32:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个就留到下次再说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's for another time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.84,1:32:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德的方法 主要基于一种神秘的仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackwood's method is based on a ritualistic mystical system
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.25,1:32:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这种仪式已经由四圣会沿用了几个世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's been employed by the Temple of the Four Order for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.10,1:32:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为了能完全深入的了解这个仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To fully understand the system, to get inside it,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.62,1:32:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我重塑了地穴中被打断的那个仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recreated the ceremony we interuppted at the crypt,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.24,1:32:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在下还稍微做了点改进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a few enhancements of my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.47,1:32:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的旅程带我到达了 比我想象中更遥远的兔子洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My journey took me further down the rabbit hole than I intended
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.82,1:33:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管弄脏了我那毛茸茸的白尾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and though I don'tneed my fluffy white tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.71,1:33:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但我受到了启发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have emerged, enlightened.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.32,1:33:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,直接控制帝权的兄弟会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fraternity who decidedly control the empire
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.16,1:33:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,崇信所有国王 法老和古代帝王的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who share the belief of kings, pharaohs and emperors of old
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.40,1:33:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,认为斯芬克斯是通往另一个维度的大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the Sphinx was a door to another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.42,1:33:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是一条通往无上力量的大道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gateway to immeasurable power.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.61,1:33:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,它由四个部分组成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's made up of four parts.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.22,1:33:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,狮足 牛尾 鹰翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The foot of a lion, the tail of an ox, the wings of an eagle
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.92,1:33:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,和人首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the head of a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.67,1:33:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我在托马斯爵士的密室里 找到了一根牛骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In sir Thomas's secret chamber, I found a bone of an ox
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.99,1:33:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,狮牙 鹰羽 以及人的毛发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the tooth of a lion, the feather of an eagle and a hair of a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.36,1:33:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,把地图拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Map.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.39,1:33:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这些星型记号代表了被杀的五个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The points of the stars represent the the five murdered girls
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.27,1:33:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在重要的是这个叉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the cross is what were now intrested in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.40,1:33:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有一种被广泛接受的说法 认为大城市中的建筑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a wildly held belief, that within the architecture of the great cities
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.24,1:33:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是仪式的解碼参考\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are coded references to the system
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.36,1:33:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,自从布莱克伍德从坟墓中复活之后 他杀了三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since he rose from the grave, Blackwood's killed three men.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.95,1:33:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,每起谋杀案都发生在 和神殿直接有关的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each murder was committed at a location that has a direct connection with the temple
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.94,1:33:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是和仪式相关之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}therefore a system .
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.67,1:34:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,李奥丹 那个黄头发的侏儒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reardon, the ginger midget.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.67,1:34:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,代表人类 我们在这找到了他的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}represents man. We found his body here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.49,1:34:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯爵士 圣会的头目 拥有圣牛指环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Thomas... master of the temple, wore the ox ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.59,1:34:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.87,1:34:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,史坦迪 出使美国的代表 一百多年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standish, the ambassador to the U.S.. Where the eagle has been a national
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.07,1:34:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰都是美国的象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}emblem over a hundred years .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.41,1:34:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他死在四圣会的总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The headquarters of the Temple of the Four Order is where he died,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.31,1:34:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.37,1:34:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,相应地 地图将告诉我们 布莱克伍德终极行动的所在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corresponded, the map will tell us the location of Blackwood's final act
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.94,1:34:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们有了人 牛 鹰 只缺狮子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we have man, the ox, eagle, only the lion remaining.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.53,1:34:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.58,1:34:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是国会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.57,1:34:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你们四个留在这 剩下的跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright you four stay here and the rest of you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.62,1:34:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.40,1:34:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,女士优先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.89,1:34:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,照着这些指示做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow these instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.56,1:35:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 好啊 好啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, hello, hello...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.29,1:35:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,魔鬼出现了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did the devil turn up?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.60,1:35:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.63,1:35:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有好东西等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got the next best thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.83,1:35:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅 大人 我知道这么做不合正统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg your pardon my lord, I know it's unorthodox
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.99,1:35:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但这位福尔摩斯先生 对你 以及四圣会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Mr. Holmes here has been making some serious accusations about you
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.58,1:35:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,做出了严重的指控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and The Order.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.17,1:35:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.05,1:35:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,至少这解释了你是怎么当上警长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least this solves the great mystery of how you became inspector.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.08,1:36:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.52,1:36:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很久之前就想这么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've been wanting to that for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.46,1:36:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,警长 现在离我下个预约 还有五分钟的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well inspector, have five minutes before my next engagement.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.44,1:36:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不如你直接交代阴谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don'tyou engrail me with your stories of conspiracy
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.79,1:36:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 雷斯垂德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Lestrade.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.03,1:36:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.32,1:36:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好奇 柯瓦德 你是协助布莱克伍德杀了所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm curious, Coward. Did you help Blackwood in all his murders.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.60,1:36:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还只是参与了被我制止的那起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or just the one I prevented?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.84,1:36:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿的这些手工鞋很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very distinctive, those hand made shoes of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.80,1:36:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但质量一向取决于作品的疏漏之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the price of quality is often the leaking print they leave
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.26,1:36:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,话虽如此 我不得不承认 我实在是落于人后了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonetheless I confess to being completely outmatched.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.43,1:36:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,调查中所能得到的结论甚少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could deduce very little from my investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.45,1:36:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 没什么比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately there's nothing more stimulating than a
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.26,1:36:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,难办的案子更能鼓舞人的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}case where everything goes against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.79,1:37:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天中午打算杀害多少国会议员?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many members of parliament do you intend to murder at noon today.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.55,1:37:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,人 牛 鹰 狮 狮子是指国会 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, ox, eagle, lion. The lion's parliament isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.52,1:37:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.86,1:37:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不是谋杀 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not murder, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.46,1:37:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是慈悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.39,1:37:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将赐予孱弱的大众 以坚强的防卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are giving the weak masses a strong Shepard.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.27,1:37:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不出来吗 这是为了他们自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see, it's for their own...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.68,1:37:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不觉得 但我不在乎你的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But I don't care much what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.46,1:37:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想知道布莱克伍德 最终仪式的所在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just simply wanted to know the location of Blackwood's final ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.36,1:37:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你已经告诉我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you've given it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.95,1:37:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've told you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.59,1:37:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但你的衣服在无形中出卖了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your clothes say infinitely more than you could ever hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.15,1:37:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你靴子上沾的泥指明了你的所到之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mud smeared on your boots from where you'vee been walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.50,1:37:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你膝盖上粘上的红砖灰 指明了你的跪拜之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A touch of red brick dust on your knee from where you'vee been kneeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.99,1:37:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你拇指上的绷带指明了你的宣誓之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A small bandage on your thumb from where you'vee been vowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.41,1:37:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,排泄物的微弱气味 指明了你的脚踏之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A faint aroma of excrement from where you'vee been standing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.74,1:38:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不到一小时之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Blackwood laid the final toches to your ceremony in the sewers
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.09,1:38:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你和布莱克伍德在国会下方的下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beneath parliament
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.56,1:38:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次碰面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}less than an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.83,1:38:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,上下两院将在今天开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both houses meet today.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.25,1:38:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,全部政府成员都将到场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole government will be present.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.98,1:38:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你选择做布莱克伍德的敌人 真是可惜 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame you made an enemy out of Blackwood, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.73,1:38:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你本可以成为一个很有价值的盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would have made a valuable ally.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.10,1:38:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,当智慧无法为智者带来益处时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How terrible is wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.12,1:38:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,智慧还有何用呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it brings no profit to the wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.38,1:38:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在中午吸收能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We take power at noon.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.15,1:38:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那没时间可浪费了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then isn't anytime to waste then.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.14,1:38:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess not?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.61,1:39:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,都说他会从天窗出来了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you he'llbe coming out of that top window soldier boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.49,1:39:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他绝不可能从露台出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't any way he'llbe coming out of that terrace.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.34,1:39:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,确切的说那可不是天窗 对吧 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically that isn'tthe top window, is it Sailor boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.74,1:39:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么? - 是中间的窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where was he? - It's the middle window.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.23,1:39:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 你应该会很高兴知道 雷斯垂德把角色诠释地很完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, you'llbe pleased to know that Lustrate played in his role perfectly
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.53,1:39:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 我觉得他挺乐在其中的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I think I rather enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.35,1:39:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿你知道自己在干什么 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you know what you're doing, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.58,1:39:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.40,1:39:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你从柯瓦德那拿到需要的东西了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got what you needed from, Coward?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.99,1:39:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了 我轻轻松松的 把他熏出了房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I smoked him out of the room with ease.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.34,1:39:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 泰勒 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Taylor? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.62,1:39:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 船长 带我们上桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you would captain, take us onto the bridge
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.39,1:39:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,港口那边 大约在100码之外有一条隧道 能把我们带到下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Port side. proximately 100 yards beyond that you will find a tunnel, that leads us to the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.35,1:39:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这就去 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.86,1:39:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德从地狱返回 在这片土地上施了咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackwood's come back from hell and laid a curse upon this land
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.03,1:40:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,看着 布莱克伍德的魔术揭秘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold, Blackwood's magic revealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.76,1:40:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.82,1:40:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是化学武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a chemical weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.64,1:40:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,首款型号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first of its kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.98,1:40:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么推断出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deduced that, how?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.94,1:40:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,凭我口袋里的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.87,1:40:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我在屠宰场剪了条普通老鼠的尾巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I snipped this of a rather common rat at the slaughterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.03,1:41:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,注意这些蓝色斑点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notice the bluish discolouration.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.51,1:41:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,轻微的杏仁苦味是氰化物残留的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The faint smell of almonds, and traces of cyanide.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.41,1:41:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们知道小矮人究竟是什么用途了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we know what the ginger midget was working on.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.92,1:41:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它会改变战争的局势 - 是的 杀死很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It will revolutionise warfare. - Yes killing a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.64,1:41:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现还有7分钟就到中午了 我们怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, there's 7 minutes until noon. What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.94,1:41:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你的女神更喜欢直接的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She loves an entrance, your muse.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.76,1:42:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,射他 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him! Now please!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.76,1:42:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,议员们 议员们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lords! My lords.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.13,1:42:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,时间已到了 请相信的人留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time has come for any of those who believe, to remain.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.85,1:42:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,请看 布莱克伍德公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold... Lord Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.95,1:42:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们似乎很吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.36,1:42:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我从远方的坟墓中归来 是为了改变英格兰的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have returned from beyond the grave to fulfil England's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.28,1:42:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,并扩大这个伟大帝国的疆域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and extend the boundaries of this great empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.25,1:43:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听听外面那些乌合之众的喊叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to the rabble outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.13,1:43:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.89,1:43:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这些恐惧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.66,1:43:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我会用恐惧作为武器来控制他们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will use that as a weapon to control them...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.86,1:43:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后控制全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.63,1:43:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没见过这样的东西 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anything like it. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.68,1:43:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是专门设计用作防止我们破坏的装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's specifically designed to prevent us from disarming it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.18,1:43:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这些部件似乎是用来接受某种信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These components seem to be specifically designed to receive some sort of signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.92,1:43:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,电磁波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Electromagnetic waves?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.00,1:43:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一经触发 电极就会发出电荷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When triggered, the electrodes will send a charge
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.34,1:43:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,把化学药品转化成气体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}converting the chemial into gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.23,1:43:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,然后这些气体会在管道中扩散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the gas will travel up that shaft
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.04,1:43:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,经由通风系统直接进入议会大厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and filter through the ventilation system that leads directly to parliament.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.60,1:43:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,用不了几秒 即使最精壮的人也会窒息而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within seconds, the administration the most powerfull men in the world will be choking to death
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.75,1:43:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德肯定有个信号发射器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackwood must have some sort of transmitter
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.07,1:43:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可远程遥控这个装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that connects them remotely.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.38,1:43:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,仅剩3分10秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes and ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.88,1:43:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我将开创一个千秋万代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will create an empire that will endure for a millennia
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.65,1:43:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不可战胜 永恒不朽的帝国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indestructible and eternal.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.56,1:44:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.78,1:44:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无需解除装置运行 只要移除汽缸就可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to actually disarm the device, we just have to remove the cylinders.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.95,1:44:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.08,1:44:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜这里被焊死了 我们需要制造一个可控爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except that they're welded in. What we need is a controlled expolsion.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.32,1:44:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个容器导出化学品 用我的烟斗爆破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a container to direct the blast my clay pipe should service that ambition
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.29,1:44:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.88,1:44:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,想我了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.51,1:44:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望你没开枪 艾琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I rather wish you hadn't done that, Irene.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.48,1:44:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,十二响钟声响起时 我会召唤邪恶的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the twelfth chime, I will summon the dark powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.28,1:44:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,支持我的人将会受到保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of those who are with me shall be protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.57,1:45:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,其它的人 将会灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All others will perish.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.74,1:45:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,借你的烟斗用下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your pipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.60,1:45:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,打他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nut him!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.31,1:46:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,新的秩序 即将拉开帷幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new order... begins now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.09,1:46:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你在等什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.25,1:46:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.26,1:46:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能搞定吗 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you manage? - Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.37,1:47:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 我是医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.91,1:48:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you take a wrong turning somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.18,1:48:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.57,1:48:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,想法很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting assessment .
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.33,1:48:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run off.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.82,1:48:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be chasing you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.10,1:48:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,请保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fair thee well.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.55,1:49:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再逃亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.45,1:49:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉你真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.64,1:49:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you would.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.00,1:49:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.32,1:50:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没什么魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was never any magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.85,1:50:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只是些魔术的障眼法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only conjuring tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.99,1:50:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只是简单地收买了一些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The simplest involves paying people off.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.25,1:50:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,比如在你牢房外假装被施了魔法的狱警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the prison guard who pretended to be possessed outside you cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.72,1:50:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下就靠的你的名声和其它人的畏惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your reputation and the inmates fear did the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.58,1:51:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有就是精心的策划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others required more elaborate preparations.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.22,1:51:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你的墓穴上面盖的是沙石板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was sand storm slab that covered your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.17,1:51:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在你下葬前就已经敲碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had it broken before your burial
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.11,1:51:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你又粘到了一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then put back together using a mild adhesive.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.90,1:51:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,至于古埃及的秘方 我认为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ancient Egyptian recipe, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.41,1:51:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是一种鸡蛋和蜂蜜的混合物 雨水很容易就能冲掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mixture of egg and honey, that was to be washed away by the rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.52,1:51:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.18,1:51:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,至于你父亲溺死在浴缸里的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arranging for your father to drown in his own bathtub
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.99,1:51:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,用的是一些现代的科学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}required more modern science.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.74,1:51:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明的李奥丹发现了一种可致人瘫痪的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very clever of, Reordan to find a paralytic
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.62,1:51:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西在铜和水的化合物中反应生成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was activated by the combination of copper and water.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.67,1:51:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因此当水被排干净之后很难被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and therefore was undetectable once the bath water was drained.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.11,1:51:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说是确实是个挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would have been quite a challenge for me,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.38,1:51:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还好他用一些倒霉的蟾蜍做过实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had he not also tested it on some unfortunate amphibian.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.90,1:51:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,史坦迪的死原本是个谜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The death of Standish was a real mystery
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.29,1:51:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你使用相同的化合物炸掉码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you used the same compound, to blow up the wharf.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.73,1:52:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一种无臭无味易燃的液体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An odorless, tasteless flammable liquid
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.34,1:52:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,而且由一种粉色织品引燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet it burned with an unusual pink tissue.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.62,1:52:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,史坦迪进去前以为是雨水淋到身上 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Standish mistake it for rain as he entered the temple.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.85,1:52:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只需一点火星就可点燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All it took was a spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.23,1:52:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他枪里的子弹被动了手脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A simple rigged bullet in his gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.99,1:52:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,构思精妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.26,1:52:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,像所有伟大的演员 你演得惟妙惟肖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like all great performers, you saved your pierce do r istance for the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.24,1:52:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,化学武器是蒸馏氰化物所得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chemical weapon, distilled from cyanide.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.93,1:52:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是在猪的肚子里提炼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and refined in the bellies of swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.17,1:52:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果启动 议会里你的追随者都会安然无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had it worked, your followers in parliament would have watched unharmed
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.15,1:52:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但他的同僚们都会中毒身亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as their colleagues were dying around them.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.39,1:52:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不知道你给了他们解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't know that you'd given them the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.75,1:52:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,相反都以为是魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead they would have believed it was magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.06,1:52:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,于是你就掌握了最终极的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that you'd harnessed the ultimate power.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.16,1:52:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然后整个世界都会屈从 因为恐惧是最强大的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the world would have followed in fear, in the most powerfull weapon of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.89,1:52:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你期望这不仅仅是迷信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd better hope it's nothing more than superstition,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.74,1:52:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,当你在仪式上精彩的演出后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you performed all the rituals perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.10,1:53:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我会说是跟魔鬼交易了灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The devil's missing its soul, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.07,1:53:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 福尔摩斯求我放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For god's sake, Holmes cut me loose!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.36,1:53:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 得让世人认清你的真面目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, the world will see you for what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.32,1:53:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一个骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.30,1:53:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你将被真正地绞死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you will be hanged properly this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.48,1:53:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前我还可以做很多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long journey from here to the rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.49,1:54:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没带着手铐醒来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never woken up in handcuffs before.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.11,1:54:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我有过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.96,1:54:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还是裸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naked.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.64,1:54:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,暴风雨就要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A storm is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.13,1:54:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... we've still got a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.46,1:54:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 莫里亚蒂 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Moriarty... - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.79,1:54:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his name.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.17,1:54:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他是个教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he is a professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.13,1:54:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都有弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone has a weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.00,1:54:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他抓住了我的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he found mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.57,1:54:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它究竟是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it precisely?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.40,1:55:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要低估他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.74,1:55:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他和你一样卓越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just as brilliant as you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.44,1:55:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,而且更加阴险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and infinitely more devious.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.85,1:55:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.47,1:55:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你会想我吗 歇洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll miss me, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.80,1:55:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadly... yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.14,1:56:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下午好 我把笔记放到这个箱子了 先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Afternoon, sir. I put the notebook in this one, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.91,1:56:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是什么 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in these, John?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.57,1:56:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 草稿 - 草稿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scribbles. - Scribbles?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.72,1:56:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 笔记 - 这是你的冒险笔记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Notes. - The're your adventures!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.86,1:56:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想读读\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to read them.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.26,1:56:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.13,1:56:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为他会最终妥协让你离开吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think his finally come to terms of you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.82,1:56:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽 看他送给我们的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary, look at the ring his given us.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.70,1:56:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等我五分钟 我们就回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now 5 minutes here, and we'll go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.19,1:56:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our home.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.92,1:56:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小心上楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carefull on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.55,1:56:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.67,1:56:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,自杀不是他的拿手节目 他只是太喜欢恶搞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suicide is not in his repertoire. He's far to fond of himself for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.86,1:56:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.71,1:57:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.35,1:57:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在推演布莱克伍德 在绞刑中幸存的几率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to deduce in which the manner Blackwood survived his execution.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.06,1:57:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这会让思路变得清晰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearing your good name as it were.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.50,1:57:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很奇怪这对我有催眠作用 而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it had a surprising suffocating effect on, and
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.00,1:57:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我就像躺在睡神的臂弯里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was carried off in the hands off, Morpheus
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.47,1:57:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就像蚕蛹在茧里一样 下午好 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a caterpillar in a cocoon. Good afternoon, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.55,1:57:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,继续 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on with it, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.77,1:57:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,侩子手在绳结里聪明的藏了个钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cleverly concealed in the hang-mans knot, was a hook
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.25,1:57:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我的腿快要麻了 我想该下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh dear, I think my legs have fallen asleep I should probably come down.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.59,1:57:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 我们该把他弄下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, shouldn't we help him down?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.15,1:57:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 我不喜欢打断他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I hate to cut him off midstream.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.99,1:57:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.15,1:57:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,侩子手给他穿了个特殊的马甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the executioner attached it to a harness.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.25,1:57:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这样重量就被均匀分散到腰部而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus lowering the weight contributed around the waist and
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.31,1:57:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,脖子却完好无损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the neck to remain intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.06,1:57:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝 我的脸麻木了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my lord, I can't feel my cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.66,1:57:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以在地面上继续吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might we continue this at ground level?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.65,1:57:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you manage it, Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.80,1:57:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我用了吊带 腰带 和一个衣服架钩做成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I managed it with braces, belts and a coat hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.97,1:57:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,华生 我舌头要伸直了 我会继续说 但这样对你没好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Watson, my tongue is going, I would be of no use to you at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.26,1:57:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还会更糟糕吗 - 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Worse things could happen. - John.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.63,1:58:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但这些无法解释布莱克伍德没有脉搏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of this, explains Blackwood's lack of pulse
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.60,1:58:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.70,1:58:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现在来解释这个医学之谜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the medical mystery.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.42,1:58:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得恢复你的声誉 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must restore your reputation,Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.85,1:58:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有一种毒药是从杜鹃花蜜中提取出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a toxin refined from the nectar of rhododendron ponticum.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.89,1:58:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在土耳其近黑海地区非常有名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quite infamous in the region of Turkey, near the Black Sea, for it's
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.08,1:58:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它能引起显著的死状麻痹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ability to induce an apparently mortal paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.68,1:58:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,足以制造一种医学假像 误导像你一样的专业医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even for a logical and well trained mind, even one as tenacious as your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.24,1:58:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,据了解当地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's known locally as...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.96,1:58:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,格莱斯顿怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with Gladston?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.63,1:58:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,狂蜂病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mad honey's diesease.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.05,1:58:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他有效地证明了我刚才的描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His demonstrating the very effects that I just described.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.95,1:58:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他不介意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.04,1:58:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽 别担心 它经历过更惨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary don't worry. he's seen far worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.26,1:58:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.72,1:58:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,医生 玛丽小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, Miss Mary...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.72,1:58:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了 雷斯垂德警长请你跟我们立刻走一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Inspector Lestrade asks you come with me right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.43,1:58:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这次又怎么了 克拉基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it this time, Clarky?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.15,1:58:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,死者是我们的警员之一 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of our sergeants, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.26,1:58:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你抓住布莱克伍德那天 他从下水道失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went missing in the sewers the day, you stopped Lord Blackwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.24,1:58:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,管道清理工今天上午发现了他的尸体 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'mafraid the sewage workers found his body just this morning, sir
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.88,1:59:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信那名警官是第一个赶到现场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe the sergeant, was the first man at the scene...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.44,1:59:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么要帮忙的吗 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you, offcer?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.60,1:59:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,被击中了头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shot in the head.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.72,1:59:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是小口径子弹吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it a small caliber bullet?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.55,1:59:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.09,1:59:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,眉毛上有灼烧粉末吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there powdered burns on his eyebrows?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.28,1:59:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是的先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.18,1:59:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,近距离射杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point blank range.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.97,1:59:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.34,1:59:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.33,1:59:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a good boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.21,1:59:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.11,1:59:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克伍德的装置现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Blackwood's device now?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.61,1:59:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,特请处 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secret Service have it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.30,1:59:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们接管了这个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken over the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.21,1:59:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜肯定少了一块部件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet there's a piece missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.54,1:59:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂要的是装置的那一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Moriarty was after a piece of the machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.95,1:59:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the poison.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.13,1:59:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这就显而易见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing more elusive than an obvious fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.83,1:59:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,无线电部件才是装置的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wire free invention was the goal all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.76,1:59:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,艾德勒小姐只是转移我们的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Addler was just the diversion.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.90,1:59:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道我会去追她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew I'd chase after her,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.22,1:59:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而装置就会无人看管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there by leaving the machine accessible.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.46,2:00:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,无线电技术是一笔无穷的财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The technology of that kind can be worth, an untold fortune.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.41,2:00:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,想象一下 你可以通过电磁波远程控制任何机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine being able to control a radio device simply by sending a command via radio waves.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.52,2:00:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是未来 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the future, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.59,2:00:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我把最后一箱装上车了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've loaded the last of your boxes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.27,2:00:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well... - Well...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.91,2:00:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,格莱斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gladston!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.11,2:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在它跑到门口前抓住它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him before he gets to the front door.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.64,2:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clarky?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.24,2:00:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,案件重开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Case reopened.
